116   4108              ; isr: every frame. When pace gives the player a tick, last tick's
117   4108              ; registers are sent first, so that every tick's writes land at the same
118   4108              ; T-states after the interrupt, and the next tick is worked out after.
119   4108              ; Keeps every register it uses
